{"word":"Χαλδαῖος","uri":"Chaldaios","senses":[{"word":"Χαλδαῖος","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">Χαλδαῖος,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">α, ον,</span> de\nChaldée, Chaldéen, <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 3, 4,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"grec\">οἱ Χαλδαῖοι,</span> les\nChaldéens :\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> habitants de la Chaldée,\n<span class=\"ital\">au S. O. de Babylone, anc. pple nomade du N. de\nl’Assyrie et de l’Arménie,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">7, 63 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 3, 4,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Cyr.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">3, 1, 34,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Soph.</span> <span class=\"refch\">fr. 564,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> prêtres de Babylone,\n<span class=\"ital\">renommés pour leurs connaissances en\nastrologie,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 181 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">fr. 30 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arr.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">An.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 17,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc.</span></div>\n"}]}